From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mark Harfouche <mark.harfouche@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 16 May 2026 00:00:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Handle empty-output proto_gen in systemlib protobuf.bzl

An aggregator tf_proto_library (no srcs of its own, only protodeps)
produces a proto_gen with no output files. ctx.actions.run rejects an
empty outputs list. Only run protoc when there are outputs to generate.
---
diff --git a/third_party/systemlibs/protobuf.bzl b/third_party/systemlibs/protobuf.bzl
index 5e2a98b5..dd4f8e18 100644
--- a/third_party/systemlibs/protobuf.bzl
+++ b/third_party/systemlibs/protobuf.bzl
@@ -114,7 +114,7 @@ def _proto_gen_impl(ctx):
         args += ["--%s_out=%s" % (lang, outdir)]
         tools.append(plugin)
 
-    if args:
+    if args and ctx.outputs.outs:
         ctx.actions.run(
             inputs = inputs,
             outputs = ctx.outputs.outs,
